{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Survivor\u00a0is a bullet hell, a horde survivor, an action roguelite in which in addition to surviving and getting improvements you will have to meet the objectives of each mission to advance in this dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/corporation-interior.gif?t=1741488594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish objectives while surviving waves of enemies who will try to mentally short-circuit you to unlock new locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/spaceship.gif?t=1741488594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game in its original design will include 3 game modes: Campaign (or History), Survive and Extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2_campaign.png?t=1741488594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Include a lot of different maps: futuristic levels, contemporary environments, fantasy locations and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the reason for this difference in environments? Time travel? Parallel worlds? Did the developer smoke a huge Kojima? Maybe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_4_Xispa.png?t=1741488594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multitude of characters with different abilities to fight the bad guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has one or more types of damage that they inflict on enemies and unique attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill more enemies, gain more experience and collect more molecules to become stronger (by buying more things).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/player-and-weapons.gif?t=1741488594\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has 6 different weapons that can be acquired (pistols, rifles, katanas, knives, shotguns, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of character/weapon/skill combinations of your choice so you can blame the game when you die.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMPROVEMENTS AND ACCESIBILITY</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improvements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/improvements.gif?t=1741488594\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summons (Melee, Ranged, Healthy, etc)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Area Explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ShockWaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbital</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cross (front and diagonal)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Front</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Etc.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Accesibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Configurable difficulty using the accessibility system so that you enjoy, or get frustrated, you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/setting-accesibility-language.gif?t=1741488594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Self-shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick games (no more than 20 minutes if you play with both hands).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multitude of characters with different abilities to fight the bad guys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of character/weapon/skill combinations of your choice so you can blame the game when you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish objectives while surviving waves of enemies who will try to mentally short-circuit you to unlock new locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill more enemies, gain more experience and collect more molecules to become stronger (by buying more things).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/extras/corporation-exterior.gif?t=1741488594\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528820?t=1741488594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/72077aaee9890ff7a428db826bb31e62f1178d87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741488594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/d3f15c0c0a5fa33f43ee8c6389268a312f03464d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741488594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528820/d3f15c0c0a5fa33f43ee8c6389268a312f03464d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741488594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Survivor\u00a0is a bullet hell, a horde survivor, an action roguelite in which in addition to surviving and getting improvements you will have to meet the objectives of each mission to advance in this dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i